OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre to reopen
OL,4,Afollowing upgrade works
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Dench, from Gloucester, said he
OL,7,Fhad spent "a fair bit of petrol money"
OL,8,Fdriving to Wingmoor Farm Household
OL,9,FRecycling Centre, which is about 12
OL,10,Fmiles (19 km) away, and that the
OL,11,Freopening would make his life "a lot
OL,12,Feasier".
OL,14,FGloucestershire County Councillor
OL,15,FAshley Bowkett said the improvements
OL,16,Fwill "help provide a better, more
OL,17,Fefficient and reliable recycling
OL,18,Fservice for residents".
